    {
        "text": "Stop her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop that monster? Look at how many people she's already taken out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not? You're always going on about how strong you are!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I can't do it! She's a walking Catastrophe, can't you see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
