        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Captain? Where'd the captain go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The captain fell into the river...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She... she sent him flying with just a single blow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I forgot they can't understand me... Oh well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me, where is she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "She? Who are you talking about? Don't ask me, I don't know anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_blunt_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Gyaaah!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... you'll regret this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Don't just start running! Pull the captain out of the river first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_towerinside",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.5,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That person...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She might be my coworker...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, wasn't I the one who was appointed to this job? It took me forever to pry this job from Meteorite too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmmm... Maybe she's here on another mission?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, seems like the bounty hunters are retreating?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's now or never. This is our chance to get out of the village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there are other operators coming to the village, we might even have the upper hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Carol, the staircase is really dark. You should hold on to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, will you stop to talk to her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, if possible, then I might\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
