        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeeowwwwch\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wooooahh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008"
    },
    {
        "text": "My nose... my nose...! How'd this door spring open on its own...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Why is someone crouching here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grani! What's going on\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, shut up! Shhhh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Shush?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you peasants couldn't possibly understand. Did you not see that walking Catastrophe?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "No bounty hunter would be stupid enough to face her head-on! The only people foolish enough to swagger up to her are those who haven't seen her level entire cities!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, did she really! You mean she can do that all by herself\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet, don't let her hear us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, I was hoping she'd notice me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_007",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I said be quiet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Somehow these stories about her that are going around are even more outrageous than the ones we hear at Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-did that monster leave?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "I.. I think so...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_008"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew, she's finally gone... Nearly gave me a heart attack...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought just our team would be enough to handle this job, but how'd we get ourselves into this mess... How do we even deal with something like that\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Wait a sec!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$indust_intro",
        "key": "$indust_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh! You're that kid with the spear! Fancy running into you here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Chief's with you too! You delivered her right to us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grani, don't tell me you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No no, they just seemed to be so well-behaved, I let my guard down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut the chatter, and hand the chief over to us! Otherwise, you're gonna be talking to the business end of this blade real soon!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
