    },
    {
        "text": "You mean with that little knife?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Wh-when did that kid pull that spear out?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Send the signal and call the others!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, go release the rest of those bugs that we used to destroy their crops. We'll show them what happens when they try to resist us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Violent Bounty Hunter"
    },
